 R←Test_Compose_05(stopFlag batchFlag);⎕IO;⎕ML;⎕TRAP;cr;lf;crlf
⍝ DotStuff and SplitLines
 ⎕IO←1 ⋄ ⎕ML←1
 ⎕TRAP←(999 'C' '. ⍝ Deliberate error')(0 'N')
 R←T._Failed

 cr←⎕UCS 13
 lf←⎕UCS 10
 crlf←cr,lf
 →T.PassesIf('a',crlf,'..',crlf,'b')≡SMTP.Message.DotStuff'a',crlf,'.',crlf,'b'
 →T.PassesIf('..x',crlf,'y.z',crlf,'...')≡SMTP.Message.DotStuff'.x',crlf,'y.z',crlf,'..'
 →T.PassesIf'abc'≡SMTP.Message.DotStuff'abc'
 →T.PassesIf(,¨'a' '' 'b')≡SMTP.Message.SplitLines'a',crlf,crlf,'b'
 →T.PassesIf(,¨'abcd')≡SMTP.Message.SplitLines'a',cr,'b',lf,'c',crlf,'d'
 →T.PassesIf((,'a')'')≡SMTP.Message.SplitLines'a',crlf
 →T.PassesIf(,⊂'')≡SMTP.Message.SplitLines''

 R←T._OK
⍝Done
